## Passing Criteria
- Marks greater than or equal to 40: Pass
- Marks below 40: Fail

## Learning Outcomes
After completing this project, students will understand how to use constructors, inline functions, static members, and friend classes in C++.

## Conclusion
The Student Result Management System demonstrates the practical application of Object-Oriented Programming concepts in C++. It provides a simple way to display student details, count student objects, and determine results based on marks.

